  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Women&apos;s Post-Pandemic Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Asherah Foundation offers scholarships to women from all over the world who have survived civil wars, extreme poverty, forced marriages, and discrimination, among others. Around the world, 82.4 million individuals, mostly women and children, have been forced to be displaced. Under these fragile and conflict affected situations, only 13% of females are enrolled in higher education. This project works towards raising funds to help women in these circumstances continue their higher education.</narrative>
  </description>
